{% comment %}
  Custom robots.txt that explicitly allows AI crawlers alongside the standard Shopify rules.
  OAI-SearchBot powers ChatGPT live search (distinct from GPTBot which is training-only).
  PerplexityBot powers Perplexity AI search — India's #1 AI search platform.
  Google-Extended feeds Google AI Overviews / Gemini.
  ClaudeBot enables Anthropic/Claude citations.
  Bingbot feeds Microsoft Copilot.

  llms.txt brand context for AI crawlers: {{ shop.url }}/pages/llms-txt
{% endcomment %}

# THE ONREPEAT — robots.txt
# AI crawler access: explicitly allowed for GEO/AEO optimization

# ChatGPT live search (OAI-SearchBot) — powers product recommendations in ChatGPT
User-agent: OAI-SearchBot
Allow: /

# ChatGPT model training (GPTBot) — allowed for brand signal training data
User-agent: GPTBot
Allow: /

# Perplexity AI search — India's #1 AI search platform
User-agent: PerplexityBot
Allow: /

# Google AI Overviews, Gemini, and AI training
User-agent: Google-Extended
Allow: /

# Anthropic Claude / Claude.ai search
User-agent: ClaudeBot
Allow: /

# Microsoft Copilot (via Bing index)
User-agent: Bingbot
Allow: /

# Amazon Alexa AI assistant
User-agent: Amazonbot
Allow: /

# Meta AI (Facebook/Instagram AI search)
User-agent: FacebookBot
Allow: /

# Apple AI features
User-agent: Applebot
Allow: /

# Standard Shopify rules for all other bots
{% for group in robots.default_groups %}
User-agent: {{ group.user_agent }}
{% for rule in group.rules %}
{{ rule.directive }}: {{ rule.value }}
{% endfor %}
{% unless forloop.last %}

{% endunless %}
{% endfor %}

Sitemap: {{ shop.url }}/sitemap.xml
